{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02619","headline":"赠梁公 · 王绩","name":"赠梁公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲图世乐，斯乐难可常。\n位大招讥嫌，禄极生祸殃。\n圣莫若周公，忠岂踰霍光。\n成王已兴诮，宣帝如负芒。\n范蠡何智哉，单舟戒轻装。\n疏广岂不怀，策杖还故乡。\n朱门虽足悦，赤族亦可伤。\n履霜成坚冰，知足胜不祥。\n我今穷家子，自言此见长。\n功成皆能退，在昔谁灭亡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}